WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:08.750
Shingo Sawatari, the son of a city 
bigwig, approached me after school.

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:15.130
He invited me to duel at 
LDS, but it was a trap.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:22.280
Sawatari stole Timegazer Magician and Stargazer 
Magician and held Yuzu, Futoshi and the others hostage!

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.870
I'm fighting to get my dear friends back!

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:31.600
Sawatari successfully Pendulum 
Summoned before my eyes!

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:39.220
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:47.590
In duels where the field, monsters and duelists 
become one, the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:51.400
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:10.180
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:13.590
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.330
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:26.900
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:29.100
Impulse  Got it got it

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:34.310
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:45.070
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:51.990
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:55.930
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:59.330
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:09.610
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:12.950
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:22.820
The Only Hope!!  Block Spider

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:27.060
This must be a joke.

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:31.070
Pendulum Summon is the best!

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:37.510
No one can stop me anymore, Yuya Sakaki!

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:41.670
Since I can now Pendulum 
Summon, I no longer need you!

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:43.040
Let's battle!

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:50.170
Power Dart Striker attacks 
Performapal Skeeter Skimmer!

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.850
Hurry, Skeeter Skimmer!

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:08.610
I can't take it!  It might be a trap again!

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:11.650
So you won't be tricked for a third time.

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:14.930
But you still can't avoid my attack.

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:17.010
Skeeter Skimmer's effect activates!

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:22.550
When it's attacked, I can switch it to 
defense position to negate the battle once!

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:25.680
I missed?

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:29.660
But I still have other monsters 
that I Pendulum Summoned.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:33.630
Rocket Dart Striker attacks Skeeter Skimmer!

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.350
I threw nice darts!

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:50.850
I'm not done, Yuya.

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:56.680
Ultimate Dart Striker attacks you directly!

00:03:57.010 --> 00:04:01.270
You'll only have 600 life points left!

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:20.240
It's over for me!

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:21.410
No you're not!

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:25.290
If Yuya isn't giving up, 
we can't give up either!

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:29.710
I end my turn.

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:35.410
You still have life points, but do you 
still have the will to fight, Yuya?

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:40.260
I'm not the only one who can Pendulum Summon?

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:42.750
Why can someone so horrible use it too?

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:46.130
Dad, what should I do?

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:51.270
Laugh when you want to cry.

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:55.250
If you get scared and cringe, 
you can't do anything.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:58.890
If you want to win, then have 
courage and step forward.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:08.820
Why are you laughing?

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:14.550
I have to save everyone!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:16.770
My turn!

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.550
I draw!

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:27.530
I summon Block Spider!

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.890
Level 1 and 0 attack points?

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:37.930
That card is total garbage.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:39.870
And it's in attack position?

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:45.250
Since you threw away this 
card, I now have a chance.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:47.090
That used to be my card?

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:50.330
It's so low level that I don't remember.

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:56.650
As long as I have Block Spider, you 
can't attack any other monster.

00:05:56.650 --> 00:06:00.340
But that's the only monster on your field.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:01.670
What are you going to do?

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:03.250
This!

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:13.810
By switching Level 1 Block Spider to defense 
position, I can activate the spell card Mimiclay!

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:19.030
Magicians used this clay 
to create exact copies.

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:23.390
It can transform into any 
monster on the field.

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:27.490
Not just in appearance - it 
also copies its abilities!

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:33.190
So you're going to copy my Dart monster?

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:35.150
I'm copying...

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:41.170
Block Spider!

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.570
What?

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:49.250
After the spell card Mimiclay activates, 
it's Special Summoned as a monster!

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:53.710
I was wondering what you'd do, but you 
just simply doubled your garbage cards-

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:56.490
That's right.

00:06:56.490 --> 00:07:01.790
When there are two Block Spiders, they 
protect each other with their webs.

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:03.430
Block Lock!

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:06.410
Your monsters can no longer attack!

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:09.550
That wasn't within my calculations!

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:12.870
Now everything depends on this.

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:19.390
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:23.190
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:31.600
The Pendulum Cards are currently spell cards.

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:35.370
Spell cards?

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:42.910
I knew the cards chose me!

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:44.050
What?

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:47.930
I activate the spell card Cricket Close!

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:54.790
I negate two of my spell cards 
to negate your card's effect!

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.530
Two spell cards?

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:01.550
You don't have two spell cards.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.310
Too bad.

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:10.470
Since I set the Pendulum Cards, 
they're treated as spell cards!

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:17.470
I negate two Pendulum Cards!  Stargazer 
Magician and Timegazer Magician!

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:34.930
I negate Mimiclay's effect!

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:36.770
Mimiclay!

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:41.350
Mimiclay loses its effect, so it's 
destroyed and sent to the graveyard!

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:50.530
Block Spider is once again a garbage 
card with 100 defense points.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:53.070
You have 600 life points left.

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:56.550
I'll bury you along with your garbage card!

00:08:56.870 --> 00:09:00.510
I activate the Quick-Play Spell Draw Muscle!

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:08.750
When there's only one monster with 1000-or-fewer defense 
points on the field, this spell lets me draw a card from my deck!

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:16.240
If I draw a monster card, I can add its 
defense points to a monster on the field!

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:18.750
Draw!

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:20.540
I did it!

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.900
I drew Kaleidoscorp!

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:26.450
It has 2400 defense points.

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:29.370
They're added to Block Spider!

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:34.200
2400 defense points!

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:37.520
It's the same as Ultimate 
Dart Striker's attack points.

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:43.300
Due to Draw Muscle's effect, Block 
Spider can't be destroyed this turn!

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:48.750
Awesome!  Sawatari can't attack anymore!

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:50.570
Impressive, Yuya!

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:57.910
That wasn't in my calculations either!

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:02.020
...Is how you expected me to react.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:10.600
To tell you the truth, I didn't have a way 
to lower your life points to exactly 0.

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:15.150
I guess being too strong is a problem.

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:19.500
But thanks to that spell card, 
my calculations are complete.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:27.470
By tributing Power Dart Striker and Rocket 
Dart Striker, I can power up Ultimate Dart Striker!

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:41.500
Due to Power Dart Striker's effect, Ultimate 
Dart Striker gains 600 attack points!

00:10:47.670 --> 00:11:01.250
And Rocket Dart Striker's effect allows Ultimate Dart Striker to 
deal you damage even when it attacks a monster in defense position!

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:02.470
In other words...

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.370
600 points of piercing damage!

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:06.850
And I have 600 life points.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.150
Do you understand?

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:11.320
Now I have a perfect 0 finish!

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:12.320
Let's battle!

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:16.670
Ultimate Dart Striker attacks Block Spider!

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:20.170
Ultimate Full Shoot!

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:23.220
It's over!

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:00.700
Yuya!

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:02.650
I was waiting for this moment!

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:06.030
I activate the trap Empty Fishing!

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:15.350
I halve the damage to add two cards to 
my hand whose effects have been negated!

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:17.880
Cards that have been negated?

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:19.710
You don't mean...

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:20.720
That's right!

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:29.050
Timegazer Magician and Stargazer 
Magician come to my hand!

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:35.080
I'm counting on you, Timegazer and Stargazer!

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:41.110
Thank you.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:46.950
Thank you very much.

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:50.150
You two saved me.

00:12:56.950 --> 00:13:01.310
You calculated all of this to happen?

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:03.900
I wasn't calculating.  I was believing!

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:07.100
Believing?

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:11.410
I activate Ultimate Dart Striker's effect!

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:16.210
The tributed Darts monsters are 
summoned at the end of the turn!

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:19.850
I end my turn.

00:13:19.850 --> 00:13:22.150
He has three monsters again!

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:27.350
If it won't go as I calculated, 
then I'll destroy everything!

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:32.510
Sorry for putting you in a scary situation.

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:36.650
It was so thrilling that 
it gave me shivers, Yuya!

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:38.550
I also believed in you.

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:40.800
Now turn the tables!

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.550
Do it!

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:46.310
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:52.410
Let's go, Timegazer and Stargazer.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:56.480
The fun is only getting started!

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:05.580
What?

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:08.210
It's time!

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:10.080
It's finally starting!

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:12.350
Everyone, all together now!

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:18.310
Pendulum!

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:21.480
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:29.150
Today, I will show you a fabulous light show!

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:34.380
First, you can't talk about 
Pendulum without these two!

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:36.380
Timegazer Magician and...

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:38.150
...Stargazer Magician!

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:39.510
Exactly!

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:44.330
Let's have today's two stars show up!

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:47.780
Everyone, you know the cheer, right?

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.300
Of course!

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:59.580
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:18.460
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:21.430
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:24.680
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:26.410
Pendulum Summon!

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:29.380
Come out, my monsters!

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:35.910
Performapal Turn Toad!

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:39.750
Performapal Kaleidoscorp!

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:45.480
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:50.950
Hooray!  He did it!

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:52.850
Perfect, Yuya!

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:54.650
Perfect?  Whatever!

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:57.110
It's Level 6, but it only 
has 100 attack points?

00:15:57.110 --> 00:15:59.280
And another has 0 attack points?

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:02.510
They're all garbage cards!

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:06.310
Oh really?  We'll see about that!

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:10.750
Performapal Kaleidoscorp's 
effect is a wonder!

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:14.810
Everyone, don't close your eyes 
no matter how bright it gets!

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:18.090
Performapal Kaleidoscorp's effect activates!

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:20.480
Kaleido Search!

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:27.650
What's happening?

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:34.310
This effect activates when there's a monster 
on your field that was Pendulum Summoned.

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:39.780
The monster you Pendulum Summoned 
is Ultimate Dart Striker.

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:41.610
So what?

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:46.250
I also select a Pendulum Monster.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:48.220
And then...

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:02.550
It can attack each of your monsters once!

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:05.110
This is Kaleido Mirage!

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:14.780
How beautiful!

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:19.310
I also want to keep watching, 
but I'm in the middle of a duel.

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:23.260
Next, I'll show you how Odd-Eyes battles!

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:24.610
Let's battle!

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:30.200
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon 
attacks Ultimate Dart Striker!

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:35.910
Everyone, do you know Odd-Eyes 
Pendulum Dragon's effect?

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:41.610
When it attacks a Level 5-or-higher 
monster, damage is doubled!

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:47.180
Exactly!  Therefore, you 
take double the damage!

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:49.280
Double?

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:59.280
I'm gonna keep going!

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:02.410
Attack Rocket Dart Striker this time!

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:06.110
Of course, the damage is...

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:07.680
...doubled!

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:10.540
Again?

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:19.480
Attack Power Dart Striker!

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:26.720
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:30.050
And the damage is...

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:32.930
Doubled!

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:36.160
I know!

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:46.480
You did whatever you wanted.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:51.110
But I still have life points left!

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:52.750
This is bad!

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:56.650
It wasn't enough for Yuya to win!

00:18:57.450 --> 00:19:00.620
Don't worry.  Look at the 
expression on Yuya's face.

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:06.350
Yuya is going to win.

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:08.710
Yeah!  Do it!

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:11.550
Everyone, thanks for waiting!

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:14.110
Here comes tonight's lead actors!

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:15.750
Lead actors?  Nonsense!

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:19.080
They're monsters with 0 attack 
points in defense position.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:22.510
You're right.  They currently can't attack.

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:25.350
But don't worry!

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:26.180
What?

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:30.750
Performapal Turn Toad can 
turn something around.

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:32.110
And that's...

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:34.750
Turn it over!

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:39.830
It turns over!

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:47.110
Block Spider has 1200 attack points?

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:48.080
That's right.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:55.180
Turn Toad's effect switches it from defense to attack 
position, and its attack points become half its defense points.

00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:57.270
It can't be...

00:19:57.270 --> 00:20:07.010
If you have 1200 life points left and Block Spider attacks 
with 1200 attack points, how many life points will you have left?

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.980
I'll have...

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:12.880
Everyone, do you know?

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:14.560
Of course!

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:18.550
In that case, all together now!

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:22.180
Block Spider attacks you directly!

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:24.470
The answer is...

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.410
Zero!

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:38.210
You did it, Yuya!

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:51.610
I'll take your cards by force!

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:53.170
Everyone, get 'em!

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:54.180
Right!

00:20:58.150 --> 00:20:59.910
What?

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:06.150
These guys are so not cool.

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:08.180
You did this?

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:11.950
You were awesome!

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:14.980
You're also a LDS student?

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:18.210
I was thinking of becoming 
one, but not anymore.

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:20.710
I'll be your student.

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:24.330
My student?

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:29.150
Yeah.  If I'm going to learn, may 
as well learn from someone fun.

00:21:29.150 --> 00:21:33.980
Since arriving here, you're 
the most fun person I've seen.

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:36.510
You did this?

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:39.480
They're only unconscious.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:42.310
I'm Sora Shiunin.

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:43.450
Nice to meet you!

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:46.550
Yeah...

00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:49.710
Go after them!

00:21:49.710 --> 00:21:51.290
Take his Pendulum Cards!

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:53.350
No, it's fine.

00:21:54.550 --> 00:21:55.880
President?

00:21:56.680 --> 00:21:59.870
He put on a good show.

00:22:03.080 --> 00:22:05.810
Yuya Sakaki...

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:18.740
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:28.220
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:40.230
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.490 --> 00:22:45.470
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:50.910
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:56.170
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:01.770
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:06.190
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:12.160
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:17.570
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.570 --> 00:23:22.870
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:32.240
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:40.460
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:44.610 --> 00:23:48.110
You're incredible!  Be my master!

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:50.780
That's fine, right?  Right?

00:23:51.550 --> 00:23:53.810
What's with you?

00:23:53.810 --> 00:23:56.450
He's following you all the time.

00:23:56.450 --> 00:24:01.850
C'mon, Master.  Show me your Pendulum Summon!

00:24:01.850 --> 00:24:05.260
I am not your master!

00:24:05.260 --> 00:24:11.080
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Aspiring Apprentice!?
Strange Admirer Sora Shiunin

00:24:11.080 --> 00:24:13.580
The fun is only getting started!
